{"seq":1,"slug":"lsp-protocol","title":"LSP 协议详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/language-server/lsp-protocol","wordCount":886,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lsp-协议详解\">LSP 协议详解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语言服务器协议（Language Server Protocol，LSP）是由微软提出的一种开放协议，用于<strong>将编程语言的智能特性（代码补全、跳转定义、错误诊断等）与编辑器解耦</strong>。在 LSP 出现之前，每个编辑器都需要为每种语言单独实现智能特性，形成 M×N 的组合爆炸。LSP 将问题简化为 M+N：语言实现方只需编写一个语言服务器，编辑器只需实现一个 LSP 客户端。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[VS Code] --&gt; D[LSP 客户端]&#10;    B[Neovim] --&gt; E[LSP 客户端]&#10;    C[Sublime] --&gt; F[LSP 客户端]&#10;    D --&gt; G[TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;Language Server]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Rust Analyzer]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H\">flowchart LR\n    A[VS Code] --&gt; D[LSP 客户端]\n    B[Neovim] --&gt; E[LSP 客户端]\n    C[Sublime] --&gt; F[LSP 客户端]\n    D --&gt; G[TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;Language Server]\n    D --&gt; H[Rust Analyzer]\n    E --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H</pre><p>LSP 与传统语言集成方式的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统集成</th>\n<th>LSP 集成</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>编辑器插件内实现</td>\n<td>独立进程 + 协议通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用性</td>\n<td>每个编辑器重新实现</td>\n<td>一次实现，多编辑器复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发语言</td>\n<td>受限于编辑器插件语言</td>\n<td>任意语言实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>与编辑器主进程竞争</td>\n<td>独立进程，可利用多核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>M × N 组合</td>\n<td>M + N</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离性</td>\n<td>崩溃可能影响编辑器</td>\n<td>服务器崩溃不影响编辑器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通信模型与消息格式\">通信模型与消息格式</h2><p>LSP 基于 <strong>JSON-RPC 2.0</strong> 协议进行通信。客户端（编辑器）和服务器之间通过标准输入/输出（stdio）、套接字（socket）或管道（pipe）传输 JSON 消息。</p>\n<p>每条消息由 HTTP 风格的头部和 JSON 体组成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Content-Length: 52\\r\\n&#10;\\r\\n&#10;{&quot;jsonrpc&quot;:&quot;2.0&quot;,&quot;method&quot;:&quot;initialized&quot;,&quot;params&quot;:{}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 52\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"initialized\",\"params\":{}}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LSP 定义了三种消息类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RequestMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  id: number | string;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: unknown;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ResponseMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  id: number | string;&#10;  result?: unknown;&#10;  error?: { code: number; message: string; data?: unknown };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NotificationMessage {&#10;  jsonrpc: &#39;2.0&#39;;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  params?: unknown;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResponseMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jsonrpc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消息类型</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>是否需要响应</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Request</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>textDocument/completion</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Response</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>请求的响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notification</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>textDocument/didOpen</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 编辑器 (Client)&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器 (Server)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (Request)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult (Response)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized (Notification)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen (Notification)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: textDocument/publishDiagnostics (Notification)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion (Request)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: CompletionList (Response)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: shutdown (Request)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: null (Response)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: exit (Notification)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 编辑器 (Client)\n    participant S as 语言服务器 (Server)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (Request)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult (Response)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized (Notification)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen (Notification)\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: textDocument/publishDiagnostics (Notification)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion (Request)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: CompletionList (Response)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: shutdown (Request)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: null (Response)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: exit (Notification)</pre><h2 id=\"生命周期与能力协商\">生命周期与能力协商</h2><p>LSP 连接的生命周期从 <code>initialize</code> 请求开始，到 <code>exit</code> 通知结束。<strong>能力协商（Capability Negotiation）</strong> 是初始化阶段的核心环节——客户端和服务器分别声明自己支持的特性，双方只使用对方也支持的特性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InitializeParams {&#10;  processId: number | null;&#10;  rootUri: string | null;&#10;  capabilities: ClientCapabilities;&#10;  initializationOptions?: unknown;&#10;  workspaceFolders?: WorkspaceFolder[] | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ClientCapabilities {&#10;  textDocument?: {&#10;    completion?: {&#10;      completionItem?: {&#10;        snippetSupport?: boolean;&#10;        commitCharactersSupport?: boolean;&#10;        documentationFormat?: MarkupKind[];&#10;      };&#10;    };&#10;    hover?: { contentFormat?: MarkupKind[] };&#10;    signatureHelp?: { signatureInformation?: { parameterInformation?: { labelOffsetSupport?: boolean } } };&#10;    definition?: { linkSupport?: boolean };&#10;    codeAction?: { codeActionLiteralSupport?: { codeActionKind?: { valueSet: string[] } } };&#10;  };&#10;  workspace?: {&#10;    workspaceFolders?: boolean;&#10;    configuration?: boolean;&#10;    didChangeWatchedFiles?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitializeParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rootUri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClientCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initializationOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  workspaceFolders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClientCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    completion</span><span style=\"col